<tr><td colspan=2>A few of us went to the TOFS the other day on an impromtu mini-raid. We had a few losses, but They were quickly returned to fighting form (thank you Freyja =)) and with The ULUL leading the charge we went as far as the 6th Floor. This was one of the most exciting travels I have made, and I feel that with more than one group we could do much better. I feel the raid on the Crystal Caverns kinda flopped not due to lack of interest, but lack of knowledge. <ooc> more peeps need to be checking the WEBSITE! <ic> Anyway, with at least two Healers and two tanks, we could field a couple strong groups who by cooperating could get much higher than one alone. Any suggestions? More communication between BH members will make us stronger. </td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
