<br>
-ooc-<br>
<br>
I'm looking for two groups of 50+ for this fight. From what I've read he is insanely magic resistant, except for Disease based spells if I'm not mistaken. I am looking for this to take place around 5PM Central (6PM Eastern, 3PM Pacific) Oh, forgot to mention that this is the begining of my epic... and so we can't fail on killing him because that means I will get to go spends hours upon hours in Cazic Thule again collecting the peices of Decayed to get DarkForge again. Thank you all for your help and I hope you can be there.<br>
<br>
-ic-<br>
<br>
Have a most evil day and bleed well my brothers and sisters. RARRRRRRRRRRRRR!<br>
<br>
<br>
-Deftnoes Fiir'eal<br>
52 Shd of the Bloodhorde</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2401&lastnode_id=175">Attack on Crystal Caverns</a> (3 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2272&lastnode_id=175">Drakang</a> on 2001-10-05 09:28:57</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Okay after talking to Dizeez, I have offered my assistance and knowledge gained from many seasons crawling through the shredded remains of rygorr orcs, terrors, crystal spiders and even geonids( don't ask me to go inside the cave in WL to help with focus quest).  Since Monday the 8th is a holiday and EQ is our life I thought this would be a good day to introduce many to the wonders of the Crystal Caverns.  All from 30th through 46th season are welcome. (Actually have seen 28ths and 29ths here and 47 and 48 can still get xp from some of the geonids)  <br>
<br>
I will be in Crystal Caverns at about 1400 EST (2:00pm for those that don't like 1400) on the 8th scouting guiding groups to good hunting spots and helping however I can.  Magic users are helpful as always but a group of tanks with a cleric can also do well here.  An enchanter really helps alot going for the spiders lair.  There are alot of good items that drop here and it is a good source of money.  Don't ever destroy those stackable velium blocks or crystalline silks the sell great to tailors and blacksmiths.<br>
<br>
Maps http://www.eqatlas.com/velious/crystalcaverns.html  These are about the best I have seen.  Less confusing after you run through it a few times.<br>
<br>
For those that don't know you reach Crystal caverns inside the Rygorr fort in the middle of the Eastern Wastes at -4000, 300.  You NEED to be invis to go inside or the orcs will pounce on you.  In the back of the fort is a small building with a crystal. Click on it and in you go.  The entrance is usually safe(unless somebody pulled a train which is fairly rare).<br>
<br>
Hope to see you there.<br>
Drakang Vondraconis</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>
